#AREA Alchemist's Workshop~

#AUTHORS Psiloc ~

#HELPS
-1 ALCHEMIST WORKSHOP 'ALCHEMIST WORKSHOP'~
The Alchemist's Workshop  Ver. 1.7.4
               
The Alchemist's Workshop can be found by going east on the stream south
of the gnome village. Be prepared to talk to the MOBs and write down the 
clues that they give you (there are too many to remember).  Words in all
caps are likely to be good conversation starters.

Do not trust the hints given to you by other PCs because the clues and the 
solutions to quests will vary from person to person. Be prepared to use your 
brain a little bit if you want to learn how to make gold and enter the guild
of Alchemists.

     Revised by Emperor on October 14th, 1998.
~
0 $~

#RANGES 25 50 0 99

#FLAGS AFLAG_NODEBUG|AFLAG_NOTELEPORT

#MOBILES
#14400
yellow mouse~
The yellow mouse~
A yellow mouse scurries about here.~
It is about the right size for a mouse, but it seems a lot more muscular.
It's fur is yellow.~
ACT_SCAVENGER|ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_WIMPY|ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_INFRARED
-50 S
20 BODY_HEAD|BODY_LEG|BODY_TAIL BODY_MOUTH|BODY_TAIL|BODY_CLAW 2d25+325 3d6+14
7500 20422
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_NEUTRAL
>rand_prog 10~
mpecho The mouse looks for some grass to eat.
~
>fight_prog 30~
if rand(40)
 say SQUEAK...SQUEAK
 say SQUEAK!
else
 say Don't kill me!
endif
~
