leader~
The packrat leader~
The leader of the rat pack scurries here.~
The toughest looking of all the pack rats.  She must have gotten her position 
by carrying the most stuff around.  She sure looks strong.  She doesn't seem
to notice you at all, but would put up a very nasty fight if provoked.~
