crypt keeper~
The crypt keeper~
The crypt keeper stands here.~
The crypt keeper stands 2.5 meters tall.  You can not make out any of its 
features because of the large cloak and cowl that it is wearing.  All you 
can make out is a set of glowing yellow eyes glowering at you.~
