 spit
else
 if rand(20)
  mpecho The surly young gnome sneaks a peek at a magazine.
 else
  mpecho The surly young gnome hums a little tune.
 endif
endif
~
>speech_prog meldrum~
say What, you want to see the old fool? I'll sell 
say you the key to the back room where he is now.  
say I doubt if you will make any sense of what he 
say says, however.
~
>speech_prog gold~
say You want to make some gold?  
say I have some catalyst right here that will change 
say ordinary rocks into gold.  I would love to sell 
say you some.  Just pour the catalyst into a bag of 
say stones and shake it up. Instant Wealth!
~
