E
straw pallet bed~
The straw is a little stale.  Any smell it may have is covered up by the 
incense.~
E
incense burners~
You don't want to get too close.  Yellow smoke pours out of them.~
E
old man~
The years of mixing chemicals has taken its toll on him.  His skin is 
dried out and has many scars.  He is 3/4 blind and coughs up blood 
occasionally.  These afflictions he bears without complaint.  Something 
else seems to have broken his spirit.  You get the impression that he 
wants to tell you his TROUBLES.~
S
