By the Mine~
The smog is thickest  here.  To the north is some mining and smelting 
equipment.  Yellow smoke rises out of them.  To the south is the opening of a 
mine shaft.  A note is stuck onto the iron grate covering the entrance. You can
travel east or west on the pathway.~
